  usecase "Gérer les commandes entrantes" as u44
  usecase "Préparer les commandes (picking)" as u45
  usecase "Gérer les expéditions" as u46
  usecase "Valider un retrait Click & Collect" as u47
  usecase "Créer et envoyer un devis" as u48
  usecase "Répondre aux questions" as u49
  usecase "Répondre aux avis" as u50
  usecase "Créer des lots (bundles)" as u51
  usecase "Consulter ses statistiques" as u52
